GoldenEye 007 XBLA PC Recomp
============================

Scope
-----

This project is based on GoldenEye Recomp by SunJaycy
(https://github.com/SunJaycy/GoldenEye-Recomp), which is released under The
Unlicense. This project's own code keeps that licence: src/, tools/,
packaging/ (except as noted below), cmake/, the build files, and this
project's changes to ReXGlue in patches/rexglue.patch (the ReXGlue code
it modifies stays under ReXGlue's licence).

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights in:

  - GoldenEye 007, its game program (default.xex), game data and assets, and
    the GoldenEye 007, James Bond, Xbox and Xbox 360 names and marks, which
    belong to their respective rights holders. None of these are included in
    this repository; players supply their own copy of the game.
  - Code that the ReXGlue code generator produces in generated/ from a
    player's own default.xex (a translation of the original game program).
    It is not part of this repository.
  - ReXGlue (the rexglue-sdk submodule) and the ReXGlue code that
    patches/rexglue.patch modifies, which remain under ReXGlue's own
    BSD-3-Clause licence (rexglue-sdk/LICENSE), including the GoldenEye Recomp
    ReXGlue fork by SunJaycy merged into that patch.
  - Code from the GoldenEye Recomp Watch Music Fix by mrfox-1 and
    contributors, which remains under the MIT licence
    (LICENSE-community-fixes-MIT.txt).
  - Third-party libraries used by ReXGlue, which remain under their own
    licences (see packaging/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt).
  - packaging/resources/installer/Extract-STFS.ps1, which is derived from
    Velocity and licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3
    (packaging/licenses/LICENSE-Extract-STFS.txt).

